<view class="page form-page"><view class="title">告别，也值得被记住</view><view class="section-note">物品离开，故事依然保留。</view><view class="mini-item"><view class="mini-art"><art src="{{item.photo}}" kind="{{item.art}}"/></view><view><view class="inline-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.dayText}}</view></view></view><view class="section-title">它是怎么离开你的？</view><view class="chips section"><view wx:for="{{methods}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{form.method===item?'selected':''}}" bindtap="choose" data-method="{{item}}">{{item}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{form.method}}"><view class="field"><text class="label">离开日期 *</text><picker mode="date" start="{{item.start}}" end="{{today}}" value="{{form.date}}" data-key="date" bindchange="input"><view class="control row"><text>{{form.date}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{form.method==='出售'}}" class="field"><text class="label">卖出价格</text><view class="control"><input type="digit" value="{{form.price}}" data-key="price" bindinput="input" placeholder="¥ 选填"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">最后想说点什么？</text><view class="control"><textarea maxlength="2000" value="{{form.note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input" placeholder="记下这次告别，或对它的感谢。"/></view></view></view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancel">继续拥有</button><button class="primary" bindtap="save">确认离开</button></view></view>
